1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,120
Create a normaly around what you want to do and who you want to become.
让你想做的事、想成为的人，变成日常里正常的一部分。

2
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:10,600
I obsessed over being a creator and I still want to make this a full time gig.
我一直很想成为创作者，现在仍想把它做成全职工作。

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:16,880
So you want to know what I do I do nothing but watch and listen to creators that do it full time.
想知道我怎么做吗？我不断观看、聆听那些全职创作者。

4
00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:26,919
And it's a normal thing for me to see that I live in austin where a lot of people are in the industry of being creative and capitalizing off of their creativity.
这对我来说变得很正常。我住在奥斯汀，很多人从事创意工作，并靠创意创造收入。

5
00:00:26,919 --> 00:00:33,280
So I stopped viewing the things that I wanted as something above me but something around me.
所以，我不再把想要的生活看作高不可攀的东西，而看作就在身边的东西。

6
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:36,880
And it changed the way that I approached what I wanted.
这改变了我追求目标的方式。

7
00:00:36,880 --> 00:00:47,629
If you spend all day listening to people who have mastered things you want to start the starting doesn't seem so hard.
如果整天听已经掌握这些事情的人分享，你自己迈出第一步似乎也没那么难。

8
00:00:47,639 --> 00:00:56,160
I also had to realize how special this moment in my life was where I'm almost 30 no children no real responsibilities but myself.
我也意识到人生这个阶段有多特别：我快到三十岁，没有孩子，主要只需要对自己负责。

9
00:00:56,160 --> 00:01:08,319
And because I had already lived 20 plus years a certain way I'm just genuinely curious of what a new life where I'm genuinely paid for being authentic will bring me.
我已经按某种方式生活了二十多年，真的很好奇：靠真实地表达自己获得报酬，新生活会带来什么。

10
00:01:08,319 --> 00:01:16,280
And the curiosity is also what keeps me going it keeps me consistent.
这种好奇心也让我继续走下去，让我坚持。

11
00:01:16,280 --> 00:01:24,039
Are you truly dissatisfied with where you are are you truly bored.
你真的对现状不满意吗？你真的觉得无聊吗？

12
00:01:24,039 --> 00:01:31,400
Because when you're bored and you have the energy to do something different nothing stands in your way of that but to move forward.
当你无聊，又有精力尝试不同的事情时，就没有什么能阻止你向前走。

13
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:38,759
I'm still in the journey of trying to make things happen for me but when it does work out I will definitely let you know.
我仍在努力让事情发生在自己身上；等它成功，我一定告诉你们。

14
00:01:38,759 --> 00:01:49,879
And notice that I said when and not if because I don't have room in my mind for doubt because I'm conc consistent.
注意，我说的是“当它成功”，而不是“如果成功”，因为我不给怀疑留下空间，因为我坚持着；conc 待核。

15
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:56,759
Sometimes thoughts of doubt come within the mind but they don't stay there long because they don't feel welcome up there.
有时怀疑会冒出来，但不会待很久，因为在我的脑海里并不受欢迎。

16
00:01:56,759 --> 00:02:05,790
There's just not enough room for them to exist if I'm constantly creating and I'm constantly doing things.
如果我不断创作、不断行动，就没多少空间留给这些念头。

17
00:02:05,800 --> 00:02:14,239
There's things that I tweak there's things in ways that I try to make things better but I never stop myself from the doing.
我会调整，会设法让事情更好，但从不阻止自己继续做。

18
00:02:14,239 --> 00:02:19,440
Visualize yourself at the end of each task being one step closer to achieving your goals.
想象自己每做完一项任务，就离目标近一步。

19
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:23,840
And notice how different the conversations you're having with yourself become.
也留意，你和自己说话的方式会变得多么不同。

20
00:02:23,840 --> 00:02:29,040
I had to realize that the enemy was in my procrastination.
我必须意识到，阻碍就藏在自己的拖延中。

21
00:02:29,040 --> 00:02:35,310
If I truly feel like what I'm doing is something that is going to help people.
如果我真觉得自己在做的事情能帮助别人，

22
00:02:35,320 --> 00:02:48,390
Imagine what my life would be like or imagine what so many other people would feel if I allowed the enemy within my mind to win over my actions enough where I never even start.
想想，要是脑中的阻碍压过行动，让我根本不开始，我的生活和那些人会是什么感受。

23
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:57,360
I think because I decided I wanted to do something with a purpose and it was aligned with my soul's purpose.
我想，因为我决定做有目的、也符合自己内心使命的事，

24
00:02:57,360 --> 00:03:07,520
I had this military like mindset of making sure that what I was doing was ultimately because I wanted to be in service for others.
我就带着一种像军人那样的心态，确保最终做这些是因为想服务他人。

25
00:03:07,520 --> 00:03:13,440
And if they never receive that service I just feel like it's purposeless.
如果他们从未得到这种服务，我就觉得这没有意义。
